  "implemented": [
    "Actual host-neutral VoiceSessionManagerCore with captured real database/AgentManager/model/runtime/worker/speech references, explicit unavailable native permissions/shortcuts/actions, raw initialization/final/action/read/model ownership, current generation/setting/publication guards and shared bounded management leases.",
    "Actual portable speech/model/worker/system enumeration owners require explicit local-only policy, captured resource/runtime/environment/model proofs and native audio capability. Hosted operations refuse before effects; unavailable audio never spawns or emits speech audio. System voice enumeration retains both native child-close and buffered callback receipts; worker replacement waits for raw close and pipes.",
    "Finite21-command/four-management-event domain registry preserves preload argument/result keys/units, current read/write/owner grants, one mutation/16requests bounds, retained raw requests and no replay. Runtime paths are public presence markers, errors fixed, hosted account state empty/unavailable; no capture/action/custom-path/audio/native-permission grant is added.",
    "Protected-profile roots, actual fixed-model download/hash/file owners and selected standalone Node/script/environment resources; strict response cancellation/file closure, checksummed bounded tar extraction, private staging/publication and exact inventory deletion. Unowned/historical/changed trees are preserved, removal retains quarantine after uncertainty, and exact file unlink/empty-directory removal preserves files added during retirement.",
    "Existing recognition/speech worker CommonJS bytes join both Node and native exact resource-manifest policy, hashes and build identity as a required optional pair. Staging refuses replacement of changed/unowned/linked worker files; older artifacts without the pair keep management unavailable.",
    "Electron compatibility wrapper retains existing native/default behavior and now awaits actual voice drain before database teardown. Renderer management initialization does not request an unsupported native microphone or admit capture.",
    "Captain retry completion is fenced by mounted/current project-view identity; late replies cannot update an unmounted/replaced panel or refresh projects for its retired view."
  ],
